        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each bike is placed on a dedicated hydraulic ramp inside an enclosed multi‑axle trailer. Trained technicians fasten the wheels with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and use custom wooden crates or foam edge protectors for added stability. The seven‑layer wrap further cushions the bike, ensuring zero‑scratch delivery.</p>
