        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Jammu?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every trailer is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link at pickup, allowing you to monitor the bike’s exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, all in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend the IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy. It provides 100 % declared‑value coverage against loss, theft, or damage caused during transit. The policy also includes liability for third‑party claims, giving you complete peace of mind for your bike.</p>
