        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies by distance and traffic conditions. For the common Jammu‑to‑Delhi corridor (≈850 km), delivery is usually completed within 24‑30 hours, excluding any customs or toll delays. Our real‑time tracking and dedicated routes help maintain these timelines consistently.</p>
